- **Vector Search:** Use Cosine Distance (`<=>`) for all pgvector operations. Use `text-embedding-3-small` (1536-dim). 
- **Session Mgmt:** Use Redis (30-min rolling TTL). Track `agent_type`. 30-min inactivity window.
- **LLM Effort Modes:** Saver (gemini-flash), Balanced (gemini-flash/claude-haiku/gpt-4o-mini), Pro (gemini-flash/claude-sonnet/gpt-4o-mini), Super (gemini-flash/claude-opus/claude-sonnet).
- **Enterprise:** 2000 req/min limit.
- **Deduplication:** Threshold 0.15. Only compare same-type. Use `fusion-eval` for tuning.
- **Onboarding:** Force redirect to dashboard post-Slack-OAuth. DM onboarding link on `app_installed`.
- **Payment Migration:** Stripe to Paddle for Indian operations.

